# {{DISPLAY}} — Testing Strategy

BP §15 posture: bias toward end-to-end coverage over unit tests; type checking IS a test (tsgo in the gate); tests are part of the feature, never a later sweep. Assert real **data**, not just "it rendered" — a screen full of placeholders passes a naive load test while hiding a broken pipeline.

